auth {
  mode: basic
}

auth:basic {
  username: {{username}}
  password: {{password}}
}

docs {
  # PetClinic API

  Every request inherits Basic auth (`{{username}}`/`{{password}}`, admin/admin from the seed).
  It only matters with `petclinic.security.enable=true`; by default security is off and it is ignored.

  The POSTs store the id from the `Location` header (`ownerId`, `petId`, `visitId`, …),
  so running **Add owner → Add pet to owner → Add visit to owner's pet** chains by itself.
}
